## Title: Connoisseur
## Notes: Auto-updating macros for your best food, buff food, water, healing and mana potions, healthstones, scrolls, soulstones, mana gems, bandages, and explosives. One-click conjuring for Mages and Warlocks, smart Feed Pet for Hunters. Optimal nutrition, peak performance.
